(90069,'/h2> The local news recently aired a story on poor immigrants in the destination system. Apparently some of the families have fallen on hard times and lack the funds to even buy the most basic necessities. A few concerned citizens in the agent''s system asked me to have these clothes delivered to the needy in the destination system, which they can make use of. I''d like you to make the first leg of the trip, which is to drop off the goods at the destination. Officials at the station will take care of the rest. </span'),
(90088,'/h2> The local news recently aired a story on poor immigrants in the destination system. Apparently some of the families have fallen on hard times and lack the funds to even buy the most basic necessities. A few concerned citizens in the agent''s system asked me to have these clothes delivered to the needy in the destination system, which they can make use of. I''d like you to make the first leg of the trip, which is to drop off the goods at the destination. Officials at the station will take care of the rest. </span'),
(60077,'/h2> A number of important shareholders were aboard a transport vessel in the the dungeon system when their ship was attacked and incapacitated by Gurista raiders. Fly out there, secure the area, recover the VIPs, and bring them safely back to your agent in the agent''s station. </span'),
(56903,'/h2> You may have noticed all those marines hanging out in the loading bay. We''ve grabbed every available transport we can find, but there''s still a few left behind who need to be transported to the destination. Suffice to say, their presence is of vital importance to Federation efforts; if you''re a loyal citizen, you''ll take them to their destination. Remember to move the marines to your cargo hold before departure. </span'),
(90022,'/h2> You may have noticed all those marines hanging out in the loading bay. We''ve grabbed every available transport we can find, but there''s still a few left behind who need to be transported to the destination. Suffice to say, their presence is of vital importance to Federation efforts; if you''re a loyal citizen, you''ll take them to their destination. Remember to move the marines to your cargo hold before departure. </span'),
(60034,'/h2> While transporting Minmatar slaves from a recently close ore mine to a new mineral harvesting facility in nearby system, the convoy was attacked by terrorists, destroying the escort frigates and heavily damaging the Harbinger-class battlecruiser carrying the slaves. We believe it is likely that the terrorists will return, and in larger ships, to attempt a rescue of the slaves before we can respond with reinforcements. The window of opportunity for the terrorists is short, so it is imperative that we immediately render as much help as possible. What we need you to do is deliver a contingent of heavily armed marines recently trained in counter-boarding operations to a station closer to the site of the battle. From there, they will join other Amarr military and rescue teams for immediate transportation to the damaged cruiser. </span'),
(60056,'/h2> While transporting Minmatar slaves from a recently close ore mine to a new mineral harvesting facility in nearby system, the convoy was attacked by terrorists, destroying the escort frigates and heavily damaging the Harbinger-class battlecruiser carrying the slaves. We believe it is likely that the terrorists will return, and in larger ships, to attempt a rescue of the slaves before we can respond with reinforcements. The window of opportunity for the terrorists is short, so it is imperative that we immediately render as much help as possible. What we need you to do is deliver a contingent of heavily armed marines recently trained in counter-boarding operations to a station closer to the site of the battle. From there, they will join other Amarr military and rescue teams for immediate transportation to the damaged cruiser. </span'),
(60109,'/h2> This one was issued from high command, specifically to be assigned to you. Recently we have been picking up signals from an old ship wreckage nearby. We send a scout to go check it out and he reported a large Serpentis presence, led by a high-ranking colonel. They seem to be looting the wreckage and creating some sort of modified Megathron battleship. If you could go and eliminate this threat, we will reward you nicely. </span'),
(60027,'/h2> This shipment of Cerrocentite needs to be taken to the manufacturer on the destination. The cargo is radioactive, and while the containment units are good enough for a short period, the mineral really requires an industrial containment in a stable and controlled environment. </span'),
(60057,'/h2> This shipment of Cerrocentite needs to be taken to the manufacturer on the destination. The cargo is radioactive, and while the containment units are good enough for a short period, the mineral really requires an industrial containment in a stable and controlled environment. </span'),
(90023,'/h2> We''ve been having some trouble with deliveries ending up at incorrect destinations. I guess these shipping companies can''t be trusted to do their job properly, so I need you to fill in for them. Take these holoreels to the destination; I will reward you for the effort. </span'),
(90049,'/h2> We''ve been having some trouble with deliveries ending up at incorrect destinations. I guess these shipping companies can''t be trusted to do their job properly, so I need you to fill in for them. Take these holoreels to the destination; I will reward you for the effort. </span'),
(90070,'/h2> We''ve been having some trouble with deliveries ending up at incorrect destinations. I guess these shipping companies can''t be trusted to do their job properly, so I need you to fill in for them. Take these holoreels to the destination; I will reward you for the effort. </span'),
(90089,'/h2> We''ve been having some trouble with deliveries ending up at incorrect destinations. I guess these shipping companies can''t be trusted to do their job properly, so I need you to fill in for them. Take these holoreels to the destination; I will reward you for the effort. </span'),
(60140,'/h2> I''m glad you made your way here, you. We had an amazing breach of security earlier today when a band of Blood Raider agents managed to infiltrate one of our shipyards and steal some very valuable equipment from its compounds. We''ve tracked them down to a Blood Raider supply depot in the agent''s constellation, where they have set up a defensive perimeter in preparation for an attack. I know this might be a difficult assignment for you, you, but it''s vital that we retrieve the stolen goods from those blood-sucking vermin. Our spies tell us that the equipment we''re looking for is located in one of their storage facilities in the depot, still in its sealed container. Don''t hesitate to destroy the structure, in order to retrieve the goods. And you can keep anything extra you find there. Good luck. </span'),
(60141,'/h2> I''m glad you made your way here, you. We had an amazing breach of security earlier today when a band of Blood Raider agents managed to infiltrate one of our shipyards and steal some very valuable equipment from its compounds. We''ve tracked them down to a Blood Raider supply depot in the agent''s constellation, where they have set up a defensive perimeter in preparation for an attack. I know this might be a difficult assignment for you, you, but it''s vital that we retrieve the stolen goods from those blood-sucking vermin. Our spies tell us that the equipment we''re looking for is located in one of their storage facilities in the depot, still in its sealed container. Don''t hesitate to destroy the structure, in order to retrieve the goods. And you can keep anything extra you find there. Good luck. </span'),
(60142,'/h2> I''m glad you made your way here, you. We had an amazing breach of security earlier today when a band of Blood Raider agents managed to infiltrate one of our shipyards and steal some very valuable equipment from its compounds. We''ve tracked them down to a Blood Raider supply depot in the agent''s constellation, where they have set up a defensive perimeter in preparation for an attack. I know this might be a difficult assignment for you, you, but it''s vital that we retrieve the stolen goods from those blood-sucking vermin. Our spies tell us that the equipment we''re looking for is located in one of their storage facilities in the depot, still in its sealed container. Don''t hesitate to destroy the structure, in order to retrieve the goods. And you can keep anything extra you find there. Good luck. </span'),
(60143,'/h2> I''m glad you made your way here, you. We had an amazing breach of security earlier today when a band of Blood Raider agents managed to infiltrate one of our shipyards and steal some very valuable equipment from its compounds. We''ve tracked them down to a Blood Raider supply depot in the agent''s constellation, where they have set up a defensive perimeter in preparation for an attack. I know this might be a difficult assignment for you, you, but it''s vital that we retrieve the stolen goods from those blood-sucking vermin. Our spies tell us that the equipment we''re looking for is located in one of their storage facilities in the depot, still in its sealed container. Don''t hesitate to destroy the structure, in order to retrieve the goods. And you can keep anything extra you find there. Good luck. </span'),
(57871,'/h2> Miners stopping by the agent''s station for supplies is a common occurrence. It so happens that a few of them left off in a hurry, and forgot a load of drill parts in the cargo bay. Fortunately for them the containers were marked, which allowed us to trace the owners quickly enough. When we contacted them they requested we send the parts to the destination, for a fee of course. If you''ll do the honors of transporting the goods, a part of that fee will be yours. </span'),
(57884,'/h2> Miners stopping by the agent''s station for supplies is a common occurrence. It so happens that a few of them left off in a hurry, and forgot a load of drill parts in the cargo bay. Fortunately for them the containers were marked, which allowed us to trace the owners quickly enough. When we contacted them they requested we send the parts to the destination, for a fee of course. If you''ll do the honors of transporting the goods, a part of that fee will be yours. </span'),
(56901,'/h2> It is important to the Empire that we get a shipment of elite slaves to the destination so that the workers there do not fall any further behind schedule. Remember to move the slaves to your cargo hold before departure. </span'),
(90024,'/h2> It is important to the Empire that we get a shipment of elite slaves to the destination so that the workers there do not fall any further behind schedule. Remember to move the slaves to your cargo hold before departure. </span'),
(90025,'/h2> One of the mining colonies didn''t receive their supplies last week, and if we don''t do anything about it they''re going to starve. We have some extra supplies here that I want you to transport to the destination. </span'),
(60110,'/h2> Find the lost fleet in the dungeon and recover the data cores; destroy anything that stands in your way. </span'),
(56871,'/h2> Banidine is normally all but worthless, so real miners don''t usually bother with the stuff. Still, I''ve found a buyer who''s willing to take whatever we can mine. So, get me 20,000 units of Banidine and I''ll make it worth your while. There''s an asteroid field near here that''s lousy with the stuff – I''ve bookmarked it for you. Get back as soon as you can and I''ll arrange a little bonus. Remember to fit a decent miner to your ship before you go. If you''re having trouble finding the Banidine at the mission location, loading the "Mining" default overview will show all ores. If you''re familiar with creating custom overview settings, Banidine is shown by enabling "Veldspar". </span'),
(91004,'/h2> Banidine is normally all but worthless, so real miners don''t usually bother with the stuff. Still, I''ve found a buyer who''s willing to take whatever we can mine. So, get me 20,000 units of Banidine and I''ll make it worth your while. There''s an asteroid field near here that''s lousy with the stuff – I''ve bookmarked it for you. Get back as soon as you can and I''ll arrange a little bonus. Remember to fit a decent miner to your ship before you go. If you''re having trouble finding the Banidine at the mission location, loading the "Mining" default overview will show all ores. If you''re familiar with creating custom overview settings, Banidine is shown by enabling "Veldspar". </span'),
(57174,'/h2> you, I need you to go and procure 10 units of a very particular ice-- Azure Ice, I believe, is what you''re looking for on your scanner. I also need it within the next 24 hours, so get to that ice field! </span'),
(91015,'/h2> you, I need you to go and procure 10 units of a very particular ice-- Azure Ice, I believe, is what you''re looking for on your scanner. I also need it within the next 24 hours, so get to that ice field! </span'),
(60111,'/h2> There''s been an influx of neural boosters to our area recently, and the agent''s corporation is trying to stem the flow. We normally turn a blind eye to light drug trafficking but that only seems to have encouraged the local smugglers, who are now flooding the area with cheap, more dangerous drugs. We know where they base out of, however, and have already taken the liberty of blockading their station in the the dungeon system. What we need is a capsuleer who can go in there and check out some of the larger vessels currently in holding. You are of course cleared to engage anyone caught with illegal boosters in their cargo, although if you catch anyone be prepared for them to start shooting. </span'),
(57873,'/h2> We''ve decided to do our agents in the destination system a favor. They''ve been complaining for quite some time of being overworked and underpaid, so we''ve decided to send them the perfect gift to soothe their nerves. A few packs of tobacco should do the trick, heh heh. It''s at least something, until we come up with a better solution. Deliver the batch to the destination and a local supplier will pick it up from there and deliver it to where they''re staying. </span'),
(57885,'/h2> We''ve decided to do our agents in the destination system a favor. They''ve been complaining for quite some time of being overworked and underpaid, so we''ve decided to send them the perfect gift to soothe their nerves. A few packs of tobacco should do the trick, heh heh. It''s at least something, until we come up with a better solution. Deliver the batch to the destination and a local supplier will pick it up from there and deliver it to where they''re staying. </span'),
(90026,'/h2> Our friends in the destination are worried their oxygen supplies won''t last until the next shipment from their supplier. They''ve requested an extra batch, and we''ve promised to deliver. You''ll find the goods in your cargo hold if you agree to this task. </span'),
(90050,'/h2> Our friends in the destination are worried their oxygen supplies won''t last until the next shipment from their supplier. They''ve requested an extra batch, and we''ve promised to deliver. You''ll find the goods in your cargo hold if you agree to this task. </span'),
(90071,'/h2> Our friends in the destination are worried their oxygen supplies won''t last until the next shipment from their supplier. They''ve requested an extra batch, and we''ve promised to deliver. You''ll find the goods in your cargo hold if you agree to this task. </span'),
(90090,'/h2> Our friends in the destination are worried their oxygen supplies won''t last until the next shipment from their supplier. They''ve requested an extra batch, and we''ve promised to deliver. You''ll find the goods in your cargo hold if you agree to this task. </span'),
(90027,'/h2> We just discovered a colony of people we didn''t know were there on a nearby planet. Our diplomats are planning a trip to negotiate with them on working for us in the constellation. Please transport our supply of Vitoc to the destination. They can''t go until this stuff arrives, so hurry up. </span'),
(90028,'/h2> Slaves at a nearby station are rebelling. They''ve managed to break their way into an armory and are holding their ground there. Please transport these small arms to the station to assist our security personnel in putting them in their place. </span'),
(60112,'/h2> Hunt down the rogue Minmatar in the dungeon. Destroy his pirated prototype ship and deliver his corpse to Minmatar caretakers. </span'),
(60018,'/h2> A nearby station has suffered a life-support failure. They got the atmospheric regulators working again, but the interior temperature is starting to drop. Get the heating units over there quickly, before the place gets too cold. </span'),
(60031,'/h2> A nearby station has suffered a life-support failure. They got the atmospheric regulators working again, but the interior temperature is starting to drop. Get the heating units over there quickly, before the place gets too cold. </span'),
(60053,'/h2> A nearby station has suffered a life-support failure. They got the atmospheric regulators working again, but the interior temperature is starting to drop. Get the heating units over there quickly, before the place gets too cold. </span'),
(60019,'/h2> the agent''s corporation''s R&amp;D branch has been working on a more efficient version of Carbon-86 epoxy resin. I need you to take the latest batch to the testing facility. </span'),
(60059,'/h2> We have recently been experiencing an increase in terrorist attacks by groups seeking to free Amarr slaves in this region. Their raids have become more complex and lethal, resulting in the loss of untold millions of ISK worth of valuable property. More importantly, one of the regional governors is having his annual gala event at his estate on a nearby planet. We need you to deliver a cargo of elite conditioned slaves to a station we will designate. From there they will be transported to the governor''s estate by heavily armed ships. </span'),
(60078,'/h2> A slave named Jaliti has escaped from the house of the one of the five Heirs to the Imperial Throne. We don''t know why or how, but she has commandeered a luxury transport and is still on the run. The Heir in question, who will of course remain anonymous, demands her return, for he greatly enjoys her beauty and company. She is also privy to a great number of personal secrets that could cause great embarrassment to the Heir, and perhaps even to the Imperial Council. We intercepted a transmission indicating that she intends to meet a contact in the the dungeon system. We don''t know whom she will meet, but you must stop her and bring her back, any way you can. Alive if possible, but dead if necessary. I''m sure if you''re successful, the rewards will be substantial. We are dealing with an Heir, after all. The ship Jaliti commandeered is known to be well-armed. You might need a battle-ready frigate to bring her back. </span'),
(60113,'/h2> A Minmatar merc plans to kidnap an Amarr young noble, so we need you to take him out before he can even make the attempt. We know where he is preparing his plan. You need to get in and dispose of him before he can even make his attempt. . He''s a crafty SOB, so expect not just a fight, but some unorthodox challenges when he realizes you''re on to him. He''s especially fond of drawing pursuers into hazardous clouds. </span'),
(58091,'/h2> The regional governor herself delivered an important State of the Region speech yesterday to all her billions of faithful followers. Due to technical problems, however, this message did not reach as many citizens as it should have. Fortunately, we have managed to correct this rather quickly through dispatching a small fleet of interceptors to the problem locations. We need you, however, to take a shipment of holoreels to the station we designate, as our usual contact there is indisposed at the moment and may not be available for some time. When you deliver these to that station, our contact''s second-in-command will take charge of the cargo and facilitate further broadcasting. </span'),
