(90030,'/h2> Surprisingly, people seem to enjoy visiting the destination system. I personally think the place is rather boring, but command has ordered me to take care of some high-profile tourists for the next week. Ferry these tourists over to the destination for me, would you? That should keep them busy, at least. </span'),
