(90092,'/h2> Surprisingly, people seem to enjoy visiting the destination system. I personally think the place is rather boring, but command has ordered me to take care of some high-profile tourists for the next week. Ferry these tourists over to the destination for me, would you? That should keep them busy, at least. </span'),
(60024,'/h2> I have an important job for you, you. Because of your good standing and the fact you have successfully completed a number of missions for the faction we have decided you are worth the trust of a very important courier job. It entails bringing a large cargo of transaction and salary logs to this station from the pickup location where they have been stored for the last few weeks for a routine inspection by the authorities. This data holds information of sensitive nature on our recent business dealings, earnings and expenses and wages that we pay our staff members. Under no circumstances may any of these reports be lost, or worse yet fall into the wrong hands. Pirates have a tendency to want this information so they can sell it to our rivals. They used to have easy access to this information by hacking our transmission calls, but now that we send these reports via freight this is no longer as serious of a problem. I trust you on this, you, don''t let me down. </span'),
(60035,'/h2> I have an important job for you, you. Because of your good standing and the fact you have successfully completed a number of missions for the faction we have decided you are worth the trust of a very important courier job. It entails bringing a large cargo of transaction and salary logs to this station from the pickup location where they have been stored for the last few weeks for a routine inspection by the authorities. This data holds information of sensitive nature on our recent business dealings, earnings and expenses and wages that we pay our staff members. Under no circumstances may any of these reports be lost, or worse yet fall into the wrong hands. Pirates have a tendency to want this information so they can sell it to our rivals. They used to have easy access to this information by hacking our transmission calls, but now that we send these reports via freight this is no longer as serious of a problem. I trust you on this, you, don''t let me down. </span'),
